Boot:
```
async function boot(){
  resize(); window.addEventListener('resize',resize);
  Input.init(); ui.init();
  audio.setMuted(Store.get('lamina-muted',false)); ui.updateMuteIcon(audio.muted);
  // unlock audio on first gesture
  const unlock=()=>{audio.unlock(); if(audio.pendingTrack) ...; audio.playMusic('title'); document.removeEventListener...}
  window.addEventListener('pointerdown',unlock,{once:true}); window.addEventListener('keydown',unlock,{once:true});
  requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  while(true){
    const save=readSave();
    mode='title'; sessionEnded=false;
    ui.setTouchVisible(false); ui.showHUD(false);
    audio.playMusic('title');
    const action=await ui.title({save:!!save, saveLabel: save?..., completed:!!save?.completed});
    if(action==='continue' && save){ if(!loadGame(save)) newGame(); } else newGame();
    mode='explore';
    ui.showHUD(true); ui.setTouchVisible(true);
    ui.updateHUD(game);
    const reason=await new Promise((res)=>{sessionResolve=res; startSession();});
    if(reason==='title'){ continue; }
  }
}
```
But `audio.playMusic('title')` before unlock sets pendingTrack; then unlock plays. On first boot, no gesture yet; title shown; user presses Enter -> ui.title handler calls audio.sfx('confirm') but audio.unlock called? `ui.title` setSel calls audio.sfx but not unlock. Keydown unlock listener fires on any keydown (we add once) and calls audio.unlock then audio.playMusic('title'). Good. Also pointerdown. But `audio.playMusic('title')` in boot sets pendingTrack; unlock plays it. Fine.

If returning to title, audio unlocked; playMusic works.

`readSave`:
```
function readSave(){ try { const s=Store.get(SAVE_KEY); if(!s||s.version!==1) return null; return s;}catch{return null}}
```
Store.get already parses.

`newGame`:
```
game = { version? no, flags:{}, triggers:{}, chests:{}, seen:{}, party:[makeMember('kael',1)], gold:45, inventory:{potion:3,ether:1}, chapter:0, chapterLabel:'Capítulo I', quest:'...', journal:[], playTime:0, battlesWon:0, completed:false, mapId:'village', mapName:'Brumalva'};
game.party[0].hp = ... full;
encounterSteps=0;
