For loaded game, onEnter might not run if seen. Good.
But if `newGame`, setMap then startSession; `village_intro` runs. If user presses keys during intro? Input handlers for dialogue intercept. Movement blocked by story blocker.

`runStory(name)`:
```
async function runStory(name){
 if(!name) return;
 block('story');
 try{
  const res=await runScript(name,game,ctx);
  if(res===false){ ... fallback maybe } 
  if(res==='title'){ endSession('title'); }
